      "accession_number": "0000076334-26-000073",
      "ticker": "PH",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "8fc5d3ce-decd-497b-90d6-e2b59b5db2a5",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > Debt",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Debt",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "To fund short-term liquidity needs, we utilize a commercial paper program that is supported by our revolving credit agreement.",
      "char_start": 29910,
      "char_end": 30036,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          29974,
          30100
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 186,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "5da99929-e34d-40cd-97b0-10608923b675",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[147]",
        "source_file": "ph-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "57729a32-5523-5b72-8623-5d76fe744025"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000076334-26-000073",
      "ticker": "PH",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "8fc5d3ce-decd-497b-90d6-e2b59b5db2a5",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > Debt",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Debt",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "In August 2025, we amended our revolving credit agreement to increase the total line of credit to $3.75 billion, and authorized a corresponding increase in the commercial paper program size to $3.75 billion.",
      "char_start": 30038,
      "char_end": 30245,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          30102,
          30309
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 187,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "5da99929-e34d-40cd-97b0-10608923b675",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[147]",
        "source_file": "ph-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "33a0c7e0-cb18-5e7f-bce9-8ad6f082374d"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000076334-26-000073",
      "ticker": "PH",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "8fc5d3ce-decd-497b-90d6-e2b59b5db2a5",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > Debt",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Debt",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The revolving credit agreement expires in June 2028; however, we have the right to request a one-year extension of the expiration date.",
      "char_start": 30246,
      "char_end": 30381,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          30310,
          30445
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 187,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "5da99929-e34d-40cd-97b0-10608923b675",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[147]",
        "source_file": "ph-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "b531151d-62af-5998-b7c0-833916f5e0cf"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000076334-26-000073",
      "ticker": "PH",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "8fc5d3ce-decd-497b-90d6-e2b59b5db2a5",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > Debt",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Debt",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Advances from the credit agreement can be used for general corporate purposes, including acquisitions, and for the refinancing of existing indebtedness.",
      "char_start": 30382,
      "char_end": 30534,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          30446,
          30598
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 187,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "5da99929-e34d-40cd-97b0-10608923b675",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[147]",
        "source_file": "ph-20260331.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "e79b0e3d-10ca-5bdf-b479-bbc8bcbc6ca0"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000076334-26-000073",
      "ticker": "PH",
      "form": "10-Q",
      "section_id": "8fc5d3ce-decd-497b-90d6-e2b59b5db2a5",
      "section_key": "part-i-item-2",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > Debt",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Debt",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Issuances of commercial paper reduce the amount of credit available under the revolving credit agreement.",
      "char_start": 30535,
      "char_end": 30640,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          30599,
          30704
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 187,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "5da99929-e34d-40cd-97b0-10608923b675",
      "source_locator": {
